      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ENCOURAGED (6) showed good early speed and raced just off the lead before lifting to score comfortably at Rockhampton last start. Goes up a level but gets in light and looks a big threat. VIXENETTE (2) was safely held at Doomben last start after getting the verdict at Coffs Harbour at the previous outing. Finds the right race this time and is capable of taking this out. HERALD ANGEL (3) had a bit on her rivals last time with an impressive win at Ballina in testing conditions. Has been kept fresh with a month between runs and only needs to hold her form to be very competitive. WHISKEY MISS (10) continues to savage the line and can reel them in late if the pace is genuine. Not to be taken lightly.",
